### 4. 现有 API 实现模式

**查询模式 (参考 SessionsHandler):**
```java
// 标准查询模式，支持分页和过滤
String sql = "SELECT * FROM sessions WHERE deleted = false";
if (agentType != null) {
    sql += " AND agent_type = ?";
}
sql += " ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ? OFFSET ?";
```

**响应格式模式 (HashMap + JSON):**
```java
Map<String, Object> item = new HashMap<>();
item.put("id", rs.getString("id"));
item.put("title", rs.getString("title"));
item.put("createdAt", rs.getTimestamp("created_at"));
```

**错误处理模式:**
```java
private void wrapHandler(HttpExchange exchange, HttpHandlerFunc handler) {
    try {
        handler.handle();
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        sendError(exchange, 500, "数据库错误: " + e.getMessage());
    } catch (IOException e) {
        log.error("IO 错误", e);
    } catch (Exception e) {
        sendError(exchange, 500, "服务器错误: " + e.getMessage());
    }
}
```

### 5. 可复用的代码模式

**1. 查询模式 (复用次数最多的):**
```java
// 通用的带参数查询模式
private <T> List<T> queryList(String sql, RowMapper<T> mapper, Object... params) {
    try (Connection conn = databaseService.getConnection();
         PreparedStatement stmt = conn.prepareStatement(sql)) {

        // 设置参数
        for (int i = 0; i < params.length; i++) {
            stmt.setObject(i + 1, params[i]);
        }

        // 执行查询
        try (ResultSet rs = stmt.executeQuery()) {
            List<T> list = new ArrayList<>();
            while (rs.next()) {
                list.add(mapper.mapRow(rs));
            }
            return list;
        }
    }
}
```

**2. 向量搜索模式 (参考 SearchHandler):**
```java
// 语义搜索
String sql = "SELECT id, title, content, " +
             "1 - (embedding <=> ?::vector) as similarity " +
             "FROM table_name " +
             "WHERE deleted = false " +
             "ORDER BY similarity DESC LIMIT ?";
```

**3. PostgreSQL 数组处理模式:**
```java
private List<String> sqlArrayToList(java.sql.Array sqlArray) throws SQLException {
    if (sqlArray == null) return new ArrayList<>();
    Object[] arr = (Object[]) sqlArray.getArray();
    List<String> list = new ArrayList<>();
    for (Object obj : arr) {
        list.add(obj != null ? obj.toString() : null);
    }
    return list;
}
```

### 6. 数据库服务模式 (DatabaseService.java)

**支持多数据库:**
- SQLite (基础功能)
- PostgreSQL + pgvector (推荐，支持向量搜索)

**事务处理模式:**
```java
conn.setAutoCommit(false);
try {
    // 数据库操作
    conn.commit();
} catch (SQLException e) {
    conn.rollback();
    throw e;
} finally {
    conn.setAutoCommit(true);
}
```

